---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Block from "../components/Block.astro";
import Img from "../components/Img.astro";
import Marquee from "../components/Marquee.astro";
import Testimonials from "../components/Testimonials.astro";
---
<BaseLayout description="Website of Jeffrey Humble・Jeff is an American designer, strategist, and educator living in Berlin">
  <Section theme="white" height="small" rows={{ mobile: 22, desktop: 17, scale: 0.0215 }} bg="/images/07333593-b28c-47c8-a856-103264025be7/website_header.jpg" overlay={0.6}>
    <Block m="1/1/4/11" d="1/1/4/27" z={2}>
      <Marquee items={["STRATEGY & INNOVATION"]} textStyle="heading-1" speed={0.5} direction="right" size={4} />
    </Block>

    <Block m="1/1/2/11" d="1/1/2/27" z={5} zm={7} valignM="middle" valign="top">
      <hr />
    </Block>

    <Block m="3/1/4/11" d="3/1/4/27" z={4} zm={6} valignM="middle" valign="bottom">
      <hr />
    </Block>

    <Block m="4/2/10/10" d="5/6/18/14" z={1} zm={11}>
      <Img src="/images/f32a9052-8f85-4358-813d-c0ae1bb03e8c/Utopian_Scholastic_Jeff_floating_Intro.png" alt="utopian scholastic website jeff humble" fit="contain" width={900} height={900} />
    </Block>

    <Block m="10/2/14/10" d="6/14/9/20" z={7} zm={10} valign="top">
      <div class="rich text-block scaled" style="--scaled:26.22">
        <h1 class="center">Hi, I’m <span class="accent">Jeff</span>! </h1>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="13/2/14/10" d="8/14/9/20" z={8} valignM="middle" valign="bottom">
      <hr />
    </Block>

    <Block m="14/2/19/10" d="9/14/15/20" z={3} zm={4} valignM="top">
      <div class="rich text-block">
        <p class="text-large">I'm an innovation designer &amp; founder looking for my next challenge in tech.</p><p>Currently, I teach advanced product skills part-time at the <a href="https://www.thefountaininstitute.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Fountain Institute</a>, a company I founded in 2020.</p><p>In my spare time, I <a href="/blog">write</a>, <a href="/speaking-requests">give talks</a>, and create <a href="/resources">free resources</a> for product people.</p>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="19/2/20/10" d="15/14/16/20" z={9} valign="top">
      <hr />
    </Block>

    <Block m="20/2/22/10" d="16/14/18/20" z={6} zm={7} valign="top">
      <div class="btn-wrap" style="text-align:center"><a class="btn" href="/about">Learn More About Jeff</a></div>
    </Block>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" height="small" rows={{ mobile: 45, desktop: 22, scale: 0.0215 }}>
    <Block m="1/1/6/11" d="1/1/2/27" z={3} zm={9} valignM="middle" valign="bottom">
      <Marquee items={["What are strategy & innovation all about?"]} textStyle="heading-1" speed={0.5} direction="left" size={4} wave={90} waveFrequency={4} />
    </Block>

    <Block m="6/2/14/10" d="2/2/12/12" z={7} zm={4}>
      <Img src="/images/90edc7ca-c137-41fb-8f04-c4062404e27f/Strategy_definition_and_tools-Jeff_Humble.jpg" alt="strategy definition tools vision" fit="contain" width={1620} height={1080} />
    </Block>

    <Block m="14/2/20/10" d="2/12/12/19" z={2} zm={3} valignM="top">
      <div class="rich text-block">
        <h4>Strategy can amplify your strengths.</h4><p>Strategy can be found in the overlap between what we offer as a company, what the customer needs, and what the competition isn’t already doing. A good strategy doesn’t just restate goals. It tells us <em>how</em> to overcome challenges and do it in a way that nobody else can.</p>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="20/2/28/10" d="13/2/23/12" z={6} zm={5}>
      <Img src="/images/30b8ffc8-60fe-422e-be31-5f3895defbcc/Innovation_definition_and_tools-Jeff_Humble.jpg" alt="innovation definition tools strategic design" fit="contain" width={1620} height={1080} />
    </Block>

    <Block m="28/2/35/10" d="13/12/23/19" z={1} valignM="top">
      <div class="rich text-block">
        <h4>Innovation turns dreams into reality.</h4><p>Innovation is how we move beyond our users’ expectations into their aspirations. Reaching this aspirational level takes a lot of research and experimentation, but the insights you will gain will be invaluable. Discovering new ways to solve unmet customer needs and desires is always lucrative.</p>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="39/1/46/9" d="3/20/10/27" z={8} zm={10} valignM="top">
      <div class="rich text-block" style="background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding:6% 6% 6% 6%">
        <h3>Want to level up in strategy &amp; innovation?</h3><p><span class="white">Jeff can ensure that your strategy and innovation operations reach their full potential. </span></p><p><a href="/services" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Book a consultation call here</strong></a><span class="white">.</span></p>
      </div>
    </Block>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" height={10} rows={{ mobile: 6, desktop: 5, scale: 0.0215 }}>
    <Block m="1/2/3/10" d="1/7/3/21" z={4} zm={9} valignM="top" valign="bottom">
      <div class="rich text-block">
        <h2 class="center">Former Clients</h2>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="3/1/4/11" d="4/1/5/27" z={5} zm={10}>
      <hr />
    </Block>

    <Block m="4/1/6/11" d="2/1/4/27" z={2} zm={8}>
      <Marquee items={["・SAP LeanIX・Hatch Leadership Ateliers・DeepC・BCG Digital Ventures・Ecosia・Twitter・Lufthansa・The Olympics・Facebook・Chase Bank・NBA・Instagram・CareerFoundry・IBM・Funny or Die・Grammys・Target・ABC Family・Khoros・Paramount Pictures・Pepsi・Victoria's Secret"]} textStyle="paragraph-1" speed={0.5} direction="left" size={1.5} />
    </Block>

    <Block m="6/1/7/11" d="3/1/4/27" z={6} zm={11}>
      <hr />
    </Block>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" height={0} rows={{ mobile: 16, desktop: 15, scale: 0.0215 }}>
    <Block m="2/2/8/10" d="3/7/13/13" z={6} zm={5}>
      <a class="img-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/build-relation/newsletter-follow?entityUrn=6918133098740109312"><Img src="/images/26f8e482-499e-401a-83fb-c8fd062432b3/Jeffs_Newsletter-small.gif" alt="Jeff&#x27;s Newsletter" fit="cover" width={1080} height={1080} clip="M0.495,0 A0.505,0.336,0,0,0,0,0.329 V1 H1 V0.329 A0.505,0.336,0,0,0,0.495,0" /></a>
    </Block>

    <Block m="9/3/11/9" d="4/13/7/21" z={1} zm={2} valignM="top" valign="bottom">
      <div class="rich text-block scaled" style="--scaled:18.77">
        <h2>Jeff’s Newsletter</h2>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="11/3/14/9" d="7/13/9/22" z={3} valignM="top">
      <div class="rich text-block">
        <p class="text-large">A monthly advice letter for product makers</p><p>Trusted by 7,000+ subscribers</p>
      </div>
    </Block>

    <Block m="14/3/16/9" d="9/13/11/21" z={2} zm={4}>
      <div class="btn-wrap" style="text-align:left"><a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/build-relation/newsletter-follow?entityUrn=6918133098740109312" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe on Linkedin</a></div>
    </Block>
  </Section>

  <Testimonials theme="white" minHeight="30vh" padding="6.6vmax" items={[
    {
      "quote": "Jeff has a rare ability to make complex concepts feel intuitive and actionable. His strategic thinking is exceptional...Beyond being highly knowledgeable, Jeff is a great facilitator: thoughtful, engaging, and effective.",
      "author": "Stella Kalyva, UX & Product Designer"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"I loved working with Jeff - he's smart, emotionally intelligent, driven, and open to feedback and experimentation, all qualities I consider essential for a leader.\"",
      "author": "Megan Mulholland, Founder & Principal Consultant"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"Over the few short years, he grew tremendously as a designer and handled his work with integrity and maturity and was integral to our company's growth and success.\"",
      "author": "-Eric Freedman, Vice President of Product Innovation"
    },
    {
      "quote": "“Valuable, up to date knowledge, presented and summarized clearly, without unnecessary fluff and bullsh*t.”",
      "author": "Egon Becskei, UX Lead"
    },
    {
      "quote": "“I feel that I am in very competent hands with you. I regularly get the most updated information and experience in the UX field from you. That's a great feeling.”",
      "author": "Shida Reher, User Experience Designer"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"Jeff is smart, incredibly talented, collaborative, and is liked by all of his peers. Any employer should consider him/herself lucky to have him on their staff.\"",
      "author": "-Elizabeth Winkler, Senior Product Manager"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"Jeff is an excellent facilitator who made the learning process fun and impactful!\"",
      "author": "Csenge Csog, UX/UI Designer"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"His unparalleled work ethic, ranks Jeffrey multiple notches above his peers...he will be an amazing asset to whatever team has the opportunity to work with him next.\"",
      "author": "Luke Fernandez, Product Manager"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"Thank you so much for doing the workshop with us. We found it really useful and you did an incredible job engaging and making it actionable for us.\"",
      "author": "Ina Arnaoudova, Head of Design at Ecosia"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"I just saw a talk Jeff did in 2022 about design strategy...It turned out to be a fantastic primer that got my mind working and definitely helped pave the way for some further education in the topic. Thanks for that!\"",
      "author": "-Nando Rossi, Senior Product Designer"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"Jeff was always on hand to offer invaluable design advice. His wealth of knowledge about the tech industry never ceased to amaze me.\"",
      "author": "-Anne Higgins, UX Designer & Author"
    },
    {
      "quote": "\"Jeff was also an unselfish and supportive team member, collaborating well with designers and marketers alike - always willing to jump in and support others.\"",
      "author": "-Ami Plasse, Creative Director"
    }
  ]} />
</BaseLayout>
